            "notes": "This is the round that you need to decide which build you want to go for (think about it carefully & try to get equal stats 50/50)\n\n\u2022DEATHOD (pick this if you are dying too much) - after you get deathod, sell and rebuy phantasmic flux (1.) & sonic recharger (2.), buy vanadium injection (3.), lumerico (4.) these 4 items are important (stack hp and ability power), last 2 items are flex\n\u2022DESTRUCTION'S DIVIDE (good against any matchup) - don't buy vanadium injection, stack atk speed and ability power \n\u2022DECONSTRUCTION/ETHEREAL EXCISION (pick this if you don't have trouble surviving) - keep stacking atk speed/ability power and little bit off of weapon power\n\u2022MULTIBALL (pick this if they have way too much healing or they are Close range for example rein) - buy cybervenom & liquid nitrogen, stack ability power & atk speed\n\u2022PRECARIOUS POTENCY (pick this if your team doesnt get enough heals, good with zen) - buy Amari's antidote, stack weapon power & ability power",
